  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From momentum conservation</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mu</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>mv</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>'</mo></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>u</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>From kinetic energy conservation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>)</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>u</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>u</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p>"
